1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:30,000
= kissasia.net =

2
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:23,940
♪Her smile, her kindness, her kiss♪

3
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,820
♪Her presumptions♪

4
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:30,300
♪She was in love, she was tired, she walked away♪

5
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:32,660
♪Only tears remained♪

6
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:36,180
♪Can't hold on, can't forget♪

7
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:39,500
♪Can't let go of her all-or-nothing love♪

8
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:44,100
♪Promises became a burden after all that hesitation♪

9
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:47,500
♪Leaving longing frozen into a winter night♪

10
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:53,420
♪That girl, my girl♪

11
00:00:54,340 --> 00:00:57,540
♪The light's still on, but you're already far away♪

12
00:00:57,780 --> 00:01:01,020
♪The words reach my lips, but I can't get them out♪

13
00:01:01,380 --> 00:01:06,740
♪That girl, my girl♪

14
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:10,860
♪My voice echoes, but no one answers♪

15
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:14,340
♪Is this really how it ends for us?♪

16
00:01:31,100 --> 00:01:33,980
[You don't have to be perfect tobe worthy of Love]

17
00:01:34,020 --> 00:01:35,380
[The Early Spring]

18
00:01:35,380 --> 00:01:37,940
[Adapted from The Early Spring on jjwxc.net, Author: Gu Niang Bie Ku]

19
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:56,710
I've got three things to report.

20
00:01:58,400 --> 00:01:59,480
First,

21
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:02,710
next week's denim promotion

22
00:02:03,230 --> 00:02:04,040
is canceled.

23
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:07,000
The good news is I've already collected their deposits.

24
00:02:08,150 --> 00:02:09,590
Second,

25
00:02:10,190 --> 00:02:12,630
about the overdue payment you've been asking me to chase,

26
00:02:12,750 --> 00:02:14,590
they're asking for another two months.

27
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:16,590
He's making excuses about being broke,

28
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:17,840
saying

29
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,310
he might have to pull his kid out of kindergarten.

30
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:23,520
Last thing,

31
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:27,430
the sponsor for the ice sculpture event is cutting the budget.

32
00:02:27,630 --> 00:02:28,800
They said that's all they can offer.

33
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:32,000
Should we still do it?

34
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:38,360
I know we need money to expand into new markets.

35
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:46,680
Let's do it.

36
00:02:48,030 --> 00:02:49,120
Something is better than nothing.

37
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:50,750
Boss,

38
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:52,800
keep your chin up.

39
00:02:54,870 --> 00:02:57,840
I don't have any good news,

40
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:00,710
but I was the first one to join this company.

41
00:03:01,030 --> 00:03:02,910
As long as this company exists,

42
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:04,240
I'm not leaving.

43
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,750
Even if I don't get paid.

44
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:09,080
Just don't stress yourself out.

45
00:03:26,030 --> 00:03:26,800
Xing,

46
00:03:27,910 --> 00:03:28,960
how did it go

47
00:03:29,710 --> 00:03:31,590
with the bank?

48
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:33,800
Yes, I want to take out a loan.

49
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:35,310
Okay.

50
00:03:35,310 --> 00:03:37,800
I'll bring the property deed over.

51
00:03:38,190 --> 00:03:39,470
Okay. Thanks.

52
00:03:49,150 --> 00:03:50,000
Are you really selling it?

53
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:54,310
Take it over.

54
00:04:04,940 --> 00:04:08,660
[Episode 24]
[Shang Zhitao, Welcome Back to Beijing]

55
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:14,750
Mr. Li,

56
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:16,750
is your company looking

57
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:18,070
to expand?

58
00:04:20,270 --> 00:04:21,000
Mr. Guan,

59
00:04:22,070 --> 00:04:23,950
I'd like to recommend a great business partner.

60
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:29,390
Someone will contact you to discuss the details.

61
00:04:29,830 --> 00:04:31,310
I gave them your number.

62
00:04:33,190 --> 00:04:34,480
Thank you so much, Mr. Luan.

63
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,800
You helped us out a lot

64
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:38,390
when we needed it most.

65
00:04:39,190 --> 00:04:40,680
I'll be sure to tell Boss.

66
00:04:41,270 --> 00:04:41,870
No.

67
00:04:42,310 --> 00:04:43,240
Don't tell her.

68
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:44,720
Whether it works or not

69
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:46,480
depends on Ms. Shang's negotiation skills.

70
00:04:46,870 --> 00:04:47,950
I'm just making the introduction.

71
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:49,120
I can't decide the outcome.

72
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:51,270
One more thing.

73
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:53,070
Send me your office address.

74
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:55,270
I bought two down jackets to send over.

75
00:04:55,950 --> 00:04:56,720
Pass them to her.

76
00:04:56,950 --> 00:04:57,720
Sure.

77
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:58,630
Thank you, Mr. Luan.

78
00:05:10,860 --> 00:05:15,300
[Beijing to Harbin Flight Booking Page]

79
00:05:18,140 --> 00:05:20,940
[Complete Your Booking: Beijing to Harbin]

80
00:05:48,430 --> 00:05:49,190
Shang Zhitao.

81
00:05:55,190 --> 00:05:55,870
What's wrong?

82
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:01,720
I mortgaged my apartment.

83
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:02,950
I'm just

84
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:06,120
feeling a little down.

85
00:06:13,430 --> 00:06:14,430
Why did you mortgage your apartment?

86
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:17,430
My company can barely stay afloat.

87
00:06:19,380 --> 00:06:20,680
Everything costs money.

88
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:22,680
I'm still waiting to collect 100,000 yuan.

89
00:06:25,870 --> 00:06:27,070
If you need it,

90
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:28,120
I can help you out.

91
00:06:34,750 --> 00:06:36,430
Luan Nian, you're trying to help,

92
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:37,950
but

93
00:06:38,070 --> 00:06:39,510
I don't need it.

94
00:06:39,950 --> 00:06:41,560
I've figured something out.

95
00:06:41,750 --> 00:06:42,680
I sold

96
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:44,190
the car

97
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:45,310
and mortgaged the house.

98
00:06:45,390 --> 00:06:47,310
I still have some savings.

99
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:48,680
You know me.

100
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:49,600
I want to make it on my own.

101
00:06:55,160 --> 00:06:56,310
Why are you here?

102
00:06:58,870 --> 00:06:59,720
I'm here to apply.

103
00:07:01,430 --> 00:07:02,430
For what?

104
00:07:03,270 --> 00:07:04,310
Driver, assistant,

105
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:06,000
or boyfriend.

106
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:06,920
I'm fine with any of them.

107
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,160
You're not suitable.

108
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:12,040
How am I not?

109
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:13,270
In every way.

110
00:07:15,750 --> 00:07:16,480
Ms. Shang,

111
00:07:18,070 --> 00:07:19,120
give me a chance.

112
00:07:21,310 --> 00:07:22,120
Mr. Luan,

113
00:07:22,310 --> 00:07:23,870
this is a startup.

114
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:25,310
We're too small

115
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:27,000
for someone like you.

116
00:07:28,270 --> 00:07:29,430
I don't charge much.

117
00:07:31,270 --> 00:07:32,790
Even if we're hiring,

118
00:07:32,790 --> 00:07:33,950
we need someone local

119
00:07:34,510 --> 00:07:36,000
who can stay long-term.

120
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:37,870
If you're okay with it,

121
00:07:37,870 --> 00:07:38,870
I can move here.

122
00:07:42,430 --> 00:07:43,430
That's not necessary.

123
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,360
My next step

124
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:46,720
is expanding into digital advertising.

125
00:07:47,190 --> 00:07:48,600
It's a completely new business.

126
00:07:49,310 --> 00:07:50,950
The execution and expertise required

127
00:07:50,950 --> 00:07:52,070
aren't your strengths.

128
00:07:52,430 --> 00:07:54,160
Do you still think you're the right fit, Mr. Luan?

129
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:56,070
If you hire someone local,

130
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:58,160
training and integrating them

131
00:07:58,240 --> 00:07:59,870
will take at least six months.

132
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:02,430
If you trust my abilities,

133
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:04,720
I'll work for free for the first six months.

134
00:08:07,070 --> 00:08:07,950
Mr. Luan,

135
00:08:09,070 --> 00:08:10,920
does Lime know what you're doing?

136
00:08:11,430 --> 00:08:12,270
Doesn't matter.

137
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:24,160
Be my driver then.

138
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:30,870
Coming.

139
00:08:40,140 --> 00:08:42,380
[Disinfectant Spray]

140
00:08:43,620 --> 00:08:45,580
♪You don't care about the story♪

141
00:08:45,660 --> 00:08:47,660
♪The more company I have, the lonelier I feel♪

142
00:08:47,740 --> 00:08:49,540
♪I don't need any blessings...♪

143
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:51,960
Mr. and Mrs. Shang,

144
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:53,000
I brought you

145
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:54,460
some Beijing specialties and some health supplements.

146
00:08:54,460 --> 00:08:56,300
♪Even if it ends up being fruitless♪

147
00:08:56,500 --> 00:08:59,580
♪It's the fog, the countless thoughts that confine me♪

148
00:08:59,620 --> 00:09:01,180
♪Is it the beginning or the point of return?...♪

149
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,390
Why are you here again?

150
00:09:03,030 --> 00:09:03,870
Luke.

151
00:09:04,020 --> 00:09:05,540
♪If I don't express it precisely♪

152
00:09:05,700 --> 00:09:07,700
♪I'll be even more critical of myself♪

153
00:09:07,860 --> 00:09:10,220
♪Mountains or lakes♪

154
00:09:10,580 --> 00:09:12,380
♪I'm just a passenger♪

155
00:09:12,500 --> 00:09:16,060
♪Your radiance is like the light at night♪

156
00:09:16,420 --> 00:09:20,060
♪Shining on me, but I am running♪

157
00:09:20,220 --> 00:09:24,020
♪If I look at you from afar♪

158
00:09:24,300 --> 00:09:27,900
♪Whose sun will you become?♪

159
00:09:27,940 --> 00:09:31,540
♪I will escape from your city♪

160
00:09:31,620 --> 00:09:35,100
♪I will make sure I don't make a sound when I leave...♪

161
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:35,910
Luan Nian,

162
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:38,240
Luke doesn't look well.

163
00:09:39,900 --> 00:09:43,060
♪I will be drenched in your name♪

164
00:09:43,740 --> 00:09:47,780
♪I hate this stubbornness I was born with♪

165
00:09:47,860 --> 00:09:51,660
♪But I will still see it through♪

166
00:09:51,900 --> 00:09:55,900
♪If you can't forget me...♪

167
00:09:58,630 --> 00:09:59,320
Don't worry.

168
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:00,840
I told you I'd help take care of Luke.

169
00:10:06,380 --> 00:10:11,680
[Meat Patty]

170
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:13,200
Your new business is finally on the right track.

171
00:10:13,390 --> 00:10:14,960
Now I get to have a proper drink

172
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:16,120
with a rising young entrepreneur.

173
00:10:17,270 --> 00:10:18,270
So?

174
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:20,750
Did Luke manage to wait for you

175
00:10:21,390 --> 00:10:22,630
out there in the freezing cold that day?

176
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:27,870
He's not young anymore.

177
00:10:27,870 --> 00:10:29,550
Weren't you afraid he'd freeze to death?

178
00:10:30,750 --> 00:10:31,750
Lumi.

179
00:10:33,550 --> 00:10:34,670
After all these years,

180
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:36,150
I still owe you

181
00:10:36,630 --> 00:10:38,030
an apology.

182
00:10:38,030 --> 00:10:39,080
I was keeping it from you.

183
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:39,870
Stop.

184
00:10:39,870 --> 00:10:41,240
Do you really think I'm that clueless?

185
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:43,080
I knew something was up.

186
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:45,600
Back when you first graduated,

187
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:46,670
you were so sweet

188
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:48,030
and innocent.

189
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:49,550
Every time you saw him,

190
00:10:49,550 --> 00:10:51,150
your face turned bright red.

191
00:10:51,150 --> 00:10:52,870
The funniest one was that time in the elevator.

192
00:10:53,270 --> 00:10:54,870
I wondered what you two were up to,

193
00:10:54,870 --> 00:10:55,670
so I snuck a peek.

194
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,630
The way you looked at him.

195
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:02,200
There was one time when it was obvious.

196
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:03,750
I knew right then.

197
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,320
When?

198
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:07,550
The shady agency gave you trouble.

199
00:11:09,030 --> 00:11:10,390
Luke stepped in to help.

200
00:11:10,910 --> 00:11:11,910
That's when I knew.

201
00:11:11,910 --> 00:11:12,720
Everything clicked.

202
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:14,910
These two are definitely more than colleagues.

203
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,000
Looking back,

204
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:19,320
it really was obvious.

205
00:11:19,750 --> 00:11:20,510
Way too obvious.

206
00:11:20,510 --> 00:11:22,870
Keeping up the act was exhausting.

207
00:11:23,030 --> 00:11:23,630
Cheers.

208
00:11:29,550 --> 00:11:30,200
Tao.

209
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:32,910
How's Luan Nian treating you?

210
00:11:34,550 --> 00:11:35,910
What do you mean?

211
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:38,510
In every way.

212
00:11:38,870 --> 00:11:39,790
How does he treat you?

213
00:11:44,390 --> 00:11:45,270
Pretty well.

214
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:49,440
So he's the whole package?

215
00:11:51,310 --> 00:11:51,780
I...

216
00:11:52,150 --> 00:11:53,630
He's alright.

217
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:54,670
What about you?

218
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:56,000
How are things with Will?

219
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:57,440
Getting married soon?

220
00:12:00,750 --> 00:12:01,960
Well.

221
00:12:02,790 --> 00:12:03,840
He's pretty old-fashioned.

222
00:12:04,120 --> 00:12:05,630
His whole family is.

223
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:07,480
Also,

224
00:12:08,790 --> 00:12:10,150
I don't think they like me much.

225
00:12:11,510 --> 00:12:13,200
How could they not like you?

226
00:12:14,270 --> 00:12:16,150
I'm a millionaire from demolition compensation.

227
00:12:16,150 --> 00:12:18,120
What's wrong with that?

228
00:12:18,120 --> 00:12:19,790
Who wouldn't like that?

229
00:12:26,510 --> 00:12:28,630
Are you really not giving Luan Nian another chance?

230
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:31,960
Why are we talking about me again?

231
00:12:42,630 --> 00:12:43,320
I'll finish it.

232
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:48,240
You're in your element

233
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:49,910
when you're back in the Northeast.

234
00:12:50,510 --> 00:12:52,030
Come on, finish your drink. Don't say that.

235
00:12:52,030 --> 00:12:56,100
[Meat Patty]

236
00:12:56,150 --> 00:12:56,960
Ms. Shang,

237
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:58,750
I sent you a video.

238
00:12:58,960 --> 00:12:59,840
Take a look.

239
00:13:01,030 --> 00:13:02,030
Shang Zhitao,

240
00:13:03,750 --> 00:13:04,720
do you remember?

241
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:07,440
We promised we'd watch the aurora together.

242
00:13:08,670 --> 00:13:09,910
But you disappeared.

243
00:13:13,030 --> 00:13:14,550
You have to see them.

244
00:13:15,240 --> 00:13:16,790
They're beautiful.

245
00:13:22,150 --> 00:13:22,870
I'm sorry.

246
00:13:27,510 --> 00:13:28,840
I really am sorry.

247
00:13:29,720 --> 00:13:31,240
I know I'm a mess.

248
00:13:32,390 --> 00:13:33,340
I don't deserve to be loved.

249
00:13:33,340 --> 00:13:36,900
♪Whatever remains will be the proof♪

250
00:13:36,910 --> 00:13:38,440
I just wanted to tell you

251
00:13:40,580 --> 00:13:43,980
♪If it never crosses your mind...♪

252
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:45,080
I miss you.

253
00:13:46,960 --> 00:13:47,900
I miss you so much.

254
00:13:47,900 --> 00:13:51,620
♪Is just formless attraction♪

255
00:13:51,630 --> 00:13:52,390
I love you.

256
00:13:53,840 --> 00:13:55,440
I love you.

257
00:14:01,060 --> 00:14:06,180
♪Your breathing grows clear...♪

258
00:14:10,390 --> 00:14:11,870
Luan Nian doesn't know I recorded this video

259
00:14:11,870 --> 00:14:13,150
or have sent it to you.

260
00:14:16,790 --> 00:14:18,240
I sent you this video

261
00:14:18,510 --> 00:14:19,630
because I wanted you to know

262
00:14:20,630 --> 00:14:22,030
he really loves you.

263
00:14:22,480 --> 00:14:23,750
If you love him too,

264
00:14:24,360 --> 00:14:25,870
don't let him go so easily.

265
00:14:42,440 --> 00:14:43,150
Don't worry.

266
00:14:44,200 --> 00:14:46,390
Luke just needs two more days of IVs.

267
00:14:46,960 --> 00:14:48,200
He'll be back to his energetic self in no time.

268
00:14:50,120 --> 00:14:50,910
Luan Nian,

269
00:14:52,670 --> 00:14:53,510
thank you.

270
00:15:26,390 --> 00:15:27,630
Actually, I regret

271
00:15:28,670 --> 00:15:30,240
not hugging you

272
00:15:31,790 --> 00:15:32,960
or comforting you

273
00:15:33,870 --> 00:15:34,870
when you took Luke away last time.

274
00:15:36,900 --> 00:15:38,580
♪Her smile, her kindness♪

275
00:15:38,660 --> 00:15:41,860
♪Her kiss, her presumptions♪

276
00:15:43,620 --> 00:15:45,220
♪She was in love, she was tired♪

277
00:15:45,260 --> 00:15:48,140
♪She walked away, only tears remained♪

278
00:15:50,260 --> 00:15:52,620
♪I can't describe, hear, or find♪

279
00:15:52,740 --> 00:15:54,700
♪Her candor♪

280
00:15:56,660 --> 00:15:59,500
♪Silence replaces the words that pass down my judgment♪

281
00:16:00,020 --> 00:16:03,060
♪Let our memories be void♪

282
00:16:03,660 --> 00:16:05,220
♪Her fear, her pain♪

283
00:16:05,300 --> 00:16:08,380
♪Her dreams, the way she pulls away♪

284
00:16:10,060 --> 00:16:11,780
♪I care, I understand♪

285
00:16:11,820 --> 00:16:14,860
♪Why are we left in such a mess?♪

286
00:16:16,740 --> 00:16:19,340
♪Can't hold on, can't forget, can't let go♪

287
00:16:19,380 --> 00:16:21,540
♪Of her all-or-nothing love♪

288
00:16:23,500 --> 00:16:26,660
♪Promises became a burden after all that hesitation♪

289
00:16:26,780 --> 00:16:29,660
♪Leaving longing frozen into a winter night♪

290
00:16:30,220 --> 00:16:35,180
♪That girl, my girl♪

291
00:16:36,740 --> 00:16:39,860
♪The light's still on, but you're already far away...♪

292
00:16:41,670 --> 00:16:42,510
If it weren't because I wanted to prove

293
00:16:42,510 --> 00:16:43,840
I wanted to be with you forever,

294
00:16:45,510 --> 00:16:46,360
I'd have made you pay

295
00:16:48,910 --> 00:16:50,670
for it today.

296
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:55,480
My flight back to Beijing is tomorrow.

297
00:16:56,120 --> 00:16:56,980
Mind if I stay tonight?

298
00:16:56,980 --> 00:16:58,660
♪Her fear, her pain♪

299
00:16:58,860 --> 00:17:01,660
♪Her dreams, the way she pulls away♪

300
00:17:04,400 --> 00:17:05,160
Shang Zhitao,

301
00:17:06,350 --> 00:17:07,110
I'm sorry.

302
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:10,100
For everything that happened.

303
00:17:10,100 --> 00:17:12,460
♪Can't hold on, can't forget, can't let go♪

304
00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:14,110
I truly loved you.

305
00:17:16,200 --> 00:17:17,480
I'm sure you could tell.

306
00:17:17,620 --> 00:17:20,300
[Disinfectant Spray]

307
00:17:20,300 --> 00:17:23,180
♪Leaving longing frozen into a winter night♪

308
00:17:24,920 --> 00:17:25,880
We've still got a long road ahead.

309
00:17:27,550 --> 00:17:28,640
I'll take it one step at a time.

310
00:17:38,240 --> 00:17:38,750
You...

311
00:17:39,790 --> 00:17:41,070
I'll sleep in the guest room.

312
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:18,160
Can't sleep?

313
00:18:27,270 --> 00:18:28,160
Let me help.

314
00:18:41,750 --> 00:18:42,640
I can't sleep either.

315
00:18:46,310 --> 00:18:47,000
Luan Nian.

316
00:18:48,500 --> 00:18:51,700
♪You've got amber eyes♪

317
00:18:51,780 --> 00:18:54,460
♪You should know♪

318
00:18:56,700 --> 00:18:59,860
♪It just lights me up♪

319
00:19:00,020 --> 00:19:02,660
♪You should know...♪

320
00:19:06,550 --> 00:19:07,880
If you don't want this,

321
00:19:08,880 --> 00:19:10,200
I'll stop right now.

322
00:19:12,980 --> 00:19:16,140
♪I will go with you♪

323
00:19:16,220 --> 00:19:18,900
♪You should know♪

324
00:19:37,620 --> 00:19:43,180
♪We are in an ocean of gin♪

325
00:19:45,300 --> 00:19:51,260
♪Still you can somehow calm me down, down♪

326
00:19:54,020 --> 00:19:56,780
♪You are made of dreams♪

327
00:19:56,820 --> 00:19:59,460
♪You should know♪

328
00:20:01,820 --> 00:20:05,420
♪And dreams are made of you♪

329
00:20:05,540 --> 00:20:08,220
♪You should know♪

330
00:20:08,340 --> 00:20:09,660
♪You should♪

331
00:20:09,740 --> 00:20:12,380
♪You should know♪

332
00:20:13,460 --> 00:20:16,100
♪You should know♪

333
00:20:17,860 --> 00:20:20,460
♪You should know♪

334
00:20:21,900 --> 00:20:24,580
♪You should know♪

335
00:21:13,790 --> 00:21:15,160
She's probably fine.

336
00:21:15,160 --> 00:21:17,200
She hasn't answered her phone. I'll go check on her.

337
00:21:20,240 --> 00:21:21,000
Luan Nian.

338
00:21:22,590 --> 00:21:23,960
Is she out cold?

339
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:24,920
Dad.

340
00:21:26,310 --> 00:21:26,960
I...

341
00:21:27,720 --> 00:21:28,920
I was exhausted yesterday.

342
00:21:28,920 --> 00:21:29,960
I didn't hear the phone.

343
00:21:30,240 --> 00:21:31,510
Don't worry. Go back first.

344
00:21:31,750 --> 00:21:33,790
I'll clean up and get up soon.

345
00:21:34,030 --> 00:21:34,590
Alright.

346
00:21:35,750 --> 00:21:36,310
Mr. Shang.

347
00:21:47,310 --> 00:21:48,070
You're here.

348
00:21:54,030 --> 00:21:55,000
You two

349
00:21:55,000 --> 00:21:57,000
aren't wearing enough.

350
00:21:59,440 --> 00:22:00,750
Come upstairs now.

351
00:22:09,790 --> 00:22:10,640
Mr. and Mrs. Shang,

352
00:22:11,640 --> 00:22:12,880
I'll take responsibility for Tao.

353
00:22:20,590 --> 00:22:21,790
What's going on here?

354
00:22:22,070 --> 00:22:22,790
Explain yourselves.

355
00:22:26,880 --> 00:22:28,030
Well...

356
00:22:28,030 --> 00:22:29,000
Keep quiet.

357
00:22:33,400 --> 00:22:34,110
You talk.

358
00:22:36,240 --> 00:22:37,030
Here's the truth.

359
00:22:38,920 --> 00:22:40,550
I'm sure you already know

360
00:22:40,920 --> 00:22:42,270
about what happened between Tao and me.

361
00:22:43,270 --> 00:22:45,550
We were together for six years.

362
00:22:46,480 --> 00:22:48,270
Because of some misunderstandings,

363
00:22:49,480 --> 00:22:50,790
she broke up with me.

364
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:54,750
But when we met again this time,

365
00:22:55,510 --> 00:22:56,270
we realized

366
00:22:56,270 --> 00:22:57,830
we still had feelings for each other.

367
00:22:59,590 --> 00:23:00,720
That's basically it.

368
00:23:05,160 --> 00:23:06,550
You're not even married,

369
00:23:06,550 --> 00:23:07,550
yet you're already living together.

370
00:23:07,920 --> 00:23:09,310
That's no way to behave.

371
00:23:09,790 --> 00:23:11,750
How could you be so foolish, Tao?

372
00:23:12,350 --> 00:23:13,270
We can get married.

373
00:23:14,350 --> 00:23:15,310
I'm ready anytime.

374
00:23:23,270 --> 00:23:24,240
I'm just waiting for Tao's answer.

375
00:23:32,400 --> 00:23:33,680
I mean it.

376
00:23:33,680 --> 00:23:34,590
Mr. and Mrs. Shang,

377
00:23:36,030 --> 00:23:36,680
I know

378
00:23:36,680 --> 00:23:38,030
a woman's reputation matters.

379
00:23:38,830 --> 00:23:39,790
I'll take responsibility.

380
00:23:50,750 --> 00:23:51,880
You heard him.

381
00:23:52,640 --> 00:23:54,030
Why are we still sitting here?

382
00:23:54,960 --> 00:23:56,200
He wants to marry her.

383
00:23:56,200 --> 00:23:57,550
Let them talk it over.

384
00:23:57,550 --> 00:23:58,400
Let's leave.

385
00:24:00,640 --> 00:24:02,200
Tao, put on more clothes. Don't catch a cold.

386
00:24:04,480 --> 00:24:05,480
You two talk it over.

387
00:24:05,480 --> 00:24:06,590
We'll come back later.

388
00:24:27,270 --> 00:24:28,640
What's wrong, Flora?

389
00:24:31,510 --> 00:24:32,480
What did you call me?

390
00:24:34,680 --> 00:24:35,400
My dear wife.

391
00:24:40,750 --> 00:24:42,000
I was telling the truth.

392
00:24:42,790 --> 00:24:44,270
If we hadn't broken up,

393
00:24:44,750 --> 00:24:46,270
we'd already be married.

394
00:24:48,750 --> 00:24:50,830
If we hadn't broken up,

395
00:24:52,240 --> 00:24:53,510
our kid would probably be grown up by now.

396
00:24:56,000 --> 00:24:57,960
You really just say whatever comes to mind.

397
00:24:58,110 --> 00:24:59,160
Can you really take responsibility?

398
00:24:59,350 --> 00:25:00,030
I can.

399
00:25:04,880 --> 00:25:06,110
I mean every word.

400
00:25:09,310 --> 00:25:10,070
Back then,

401
00:25:10,070 --> 00:25:11,350
I thought I'd planned everything perfectly.

402
00:25:12,480 --> 00:25:13,790
I'd spend six months in the US,

403
00:25:14,510 --> 00:25:15,440
then come back,

404
00:25:15,440 --> 00:25:16,830
and you'd receive the Specialist title you deserved.

405
00:25:23,240 --> 00:25:23,830
Tao.

406
00:25:25,960 --> 00:25:27,310
I want to spend the rest of my life with you.

407
00:25:42,110 --> 00:25:43,960
The Beijing branch has just opened.

408
00:25:43,960 --> 00:25:46,750
From now on, I'll be splitting my time between Harbin and Beijing.

409
00:25:47,340 --> 00:25:49,980
[2021, Beijing]

410
00:25:53,680 --> 00:25:54,440
Luke,

411
00:25:54,880 --> 00:25:55,750
we're going back to Beijing.

412
00:25:58,310 --> 00:25:59,680
Luke.

413
00:26:05,510 --> 00:26:07,200
I got praised at the summit.

414
00:26:07,680 --> 00:26:08,960
Ms. Shang Zhitao,

415
00:26:09,200 --> 00:26:10,440
we'd like to invite you back to Lime

416
00:26:10,960 --> 00:26:13,160
to share your experience as one of our event partners.

417
00:26:18,000 --> 00:26:18,680
Sure.

418
00:26:21,680 --> 00:26:22,480
Shang Zhitao,

419
00:26:23,270 --> 00:26:24,550
welcome back to Beijing.

420
00:26:41,960 --> 00:26:43,030
Shang Zhitao.

421
00:26:44,960 --> 00:26:46,070
Flora

422
00:26:46,070 --> 00:26:47,160
is like a different person now.

423
00:26:49,200 --> 00:26:50,440
It's New Year's Eve.

424
00:26:50,720 --> 00:26:51,640
Don't stay out too late.

425
00:26:52,550 --> 00:26:53,920
Happy New Year in advance, everyone.

426
00:26:53,920 --> 00:26:56,000
Happy New Year.

427
00:26:56,830 --> 00:26:57,640
Flora.

428
00:26:59,310 --> 00:27:00,830
Let's grab a meal sometime.

429
00:27:00,830 --> 00:27:01,960
As friends.

430
00:27:03,550 --> 00:27:05,070
We'll talk about dinner another time.

431
00:27:05,640 --> 00:27:07,200
We're supposed to go grocery shopping together.

432
00:27:10,400 --> 00:27:11,590
Flora, I have to ask.

433
00:27:11,590 --> 00:27:13,000
How did you ever put up

434
00:27:13,350 --> 00:27:14,720
with his temper?

435
00:27:15,200 --> 00:27:16,160
Are you seriously

436
00:27:16,160 --> 00:27:17,400
gaslighting my wife in front of me?

437
00:27:26,550 --> 00:27:28,030
We're heading out. Bye.

438
00:27:28,030 --> 00:27:28,640
Bye.

439
00:27:28,640 --> 00:27:29,440
Bye.

440
00:27:38,000 --> 00:27:38,960
What's wrong?

441
00:27:39,310 --> 00:27:40,110
What time will you be back?

442
00:27:40,110 --> 00:27:41,720
We're going shopping for Chinese New Year's supplies together.

443
00:27:42,880 --> 00:27:44,070
I still have something to do.

444
00:27:44,200 --> 00:27:45,110
I'll be back later.

445
00:27:49,680 --> 00:27:50,480
Also,

446
00:27:51,790 --> 00:27:53,200
I might be bringing someone home.

447
00:28:09,790 --> 00:28:10,880
Where are we going?

448
00:28:12,880 --> 00:28:13,750
Come with me.

449
00:28:20,500 --> 00:28:24,780
[Flora's Museum of Time &amp; Eternity]

450
00:28:31,310 --> 00:28:31,790
Welcome to

451
00:28:31,790 --> 00:28:33,310
Flora's Museum of Time &amp; Eternity.

452
00:28:34,440 --> 00:28:35,920
I'm your personal tour guide,

453
00:28:37,310 --> 00:28:37,960
Luan Nian.

454
00:28:43,860 --> 00:28:47,100
♪And so, I will protect myself well♪

455
00:28:47,220 --> 00:28:49,140
♪You don't care about the story♪

456
00:28:49,220 --> 00:28:51,180
♪The more company I have, the lonelier I feel♪

457
00:28:51,300 --> 00:28:53,100
♪I don't need any blessings♪

458
00:28:53,220 --> 00:28:55,340
♪I will set the boundary♪

459
00:28:55,380 --> 00:28:57,900
♪And I will not run away♪

460
00:28:57,940 --> 00:28:59,860
♪Even if it ends up being fruitless♪

461
00:29:00,060 --> 00:29:03,140
♪It's the fog, the countless thoughts that confine me♪

462
00:29:03,220 --> 00:29:05,060
♪Is it the beginning or the point of return?...♪

463
00:29:06,550 --> 00:29:07,960
This is Shang Zhitao in 2012,

464
00:29:07,960 --> 00:29:09,220
when she first arrived in Beijing.

465
00:29:09,220 --> 00:29:11,300
♪I'll be even more critical of myself♪

466
00:29:13,240 --> 00:29:14,680
She was terrified

467
00:29:14,750 --> 00:29:15,720
but also curious

468
00:29:16,400 --> 00:29:17,440
about this unfamiliar city.

469
00:29:18,480 --> 00:29:19,880
She treated everything with awe.

470
00:29:22,880 --> 00:29:24,160
She devoted all of her time

471
00:29:24,750 --> 00:29:26,030
to work.

472
00:29:28,640 --> 00:29:29,830
Unfortunately,

473
00:29:30,000 --> 00:29:30,920
she wound up with a boss

474
00:29:30,920 --> 00:29:32,400
who tried to make her quit every day.

475
00:29:33,750 --> 00:29:35,180
That boss was a real jerk.

476
00:29:35,180 --> 00:29:39,180
♪I will make sure I don't make a sound when I leave...♪

477
00:29:39,880 --> 00:29:41,030
Luckily,

478
00:29:41,270 --> 00:29:43,960
I happened to run into my boss that night.

479
00:29:44,000 --> 00:29:45,110
He drove me home.

480
00:29:50,750 --> 00:29:51,640
Do you know something?

481
00:29:52,680 --> 00:29:54,310
The first time I drove you home,

482
00:29:54,880 --> 00:29:55,460
it wasn't on my way.

483
00:29:55,460 --> 00:29:59,420
♪If you can't forget me♪

484
00:29:59,880 --> 00:30:01,240
It never was.

485
00:30:02,400 --> 00:30:03,830
I took the long way because I wanted to drive you home.

486
00:30:05,590 --> 00:30:06,350
Get in.

487
00:30:16,660 --> 00:30:20,620
[Make every day count. Wishing you all the best as you keep growing. Anonymous]

488
00:30:23,740 --> 00:30:27,260
♪And so, I will protect myself well♪

489
00:30:27,340 --> 00:30:29,140
♪You don't care about the story♪

490
00:30:29,180 --> 00:30:31,260
♪The more company I have, the lonelier I feel♪

491
00:30:31,340 --> 00:30:32,900
♪I don't need any blessings♪

492
00:30:33,060 --> 00:30:35,340
♪I will set the boundary♪

493
00:30:35,420 --> 00:30:37,780
♪And I will not run away...♪

494
00:30:37,830 --> 00:30:39,400
Shang Zhitao, you were brave back then.

495
00:30:41,270 --> 00:30:42,920
I went there to save you.

496
00:30:43,480 --> 00:30:44,590
But in the end,

497
00:30:45,030 --> 00:30:46,350
you were the one who saved me.

498
00:30:47,460 --> 00:30:49,060
♪If I don't express it precisely♪

499
00:30:49,260 --> 00:30:51,260
♪I'll be even more critical of myself♪

500
00:30:51,300 --> 00:30:53,860
♪Mountains or lakes♪

501
00:30:53,940 --> 00:30:55,900
♪I'm just a passenger...♪

502
00:30:58,240 --> 00:30:59,110
Shang Zhitao.

503
00:31:00,200 --> 00:31:01,110
There's something I need to say.

504
00:31:04,830 --> 00:31:06,440
About the handbag.

505
00:31:08,350 --> 00:31:09,720
My mother loves handbags,

506
00:31:11,270 --> 00:31:12,920
so I mistakenly assumed

507
00:31:13,160 --> 00:31:15,030
every woman did too.

508
00:31:16,440 --> 00:31:18,000
When I gave it to you,

509
00:31:19,350 --> 00:31:20,830
I just wanted to give you the best,

510
00:31:25,920 --> 00:31:28,200
but I simply didn't know how to express how much I cared about you.

511
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:31,200
I'm sorry

512
00:31:31,590 --> 00:31:32,350
I made you uncomfortable.

513
00:31:36,480 --> 00:31:37,830
Your old bag was worn out.

514
00:31:38,550 --> 00:31:39,380
Have a new one.

515
00:31:39,380 --> 00:31:44,180
♪Please persevere, let me believe you once more...♪

516
00:31:44,200 --> 00:31:45,160
It's okay.

517
00:31:55,200 --> 00:31:57,070
I remember you complimented me.

518
00:31:58,920 --> 00:32:00,240
You hired a great employee.

519
00:32:00,680 --> 00:32:02,310
She turned my impossible into a possibility.

520
00:32:03,000 --> 00:32:05,240
The prototype of the database you've all seen

521
00:32:05,400 --> 00:32:07,310
was led by

522
00:32:07,640 --> 00:32:09,640
our new teammate, Flora.

523
00:32:11,750 --> 00:32:13,550
I just wanted everyone to know

524
00:32:14,070 --> 00:32:15,510
that you'd accomplished something amazing.

525
00:32:16,440 --> 00:32:17,350
I was proud of you.

526
00:32:36,030 --> 00:32:38,030
These are the flowers Sun Yuanzhu gave me.

527
00:32:39,000 --> 00:32:39,550
Yes.

528
00:32:42,400 --> 00:32:43,960
Actually, they suited you perfectly.

529
00:32:45,030 --> 00:32:46,640
I lied because I was jealous.

530
00:32:50,590 --> 00:32:51,680
Sun Yuanzhu was a wonderful person.

531
00:32:52,790 --> 00:32:54,000
I should've thanked him.

532
00:33:06,030 --> 00:33:07,350
Just call me Luan Nian.

533
00:33:08,790 --> 00:33:09,680
Luan Nian.

534
00:33:14,260 --> 00:33:16,660
♪I have some words♪

535
00:33:16,820 --> 00:33:18,900
♪Written in song♪

536
00:33:18,920 --> 00:33:20,920
The boss had already fallen in love with her.

537
00:33:22,440 --> 00:33:23,640
He just didn't realize it yet.

538
00:33:24,590 --> 00:33:26,620
He was the first one to fall for Shang Zhitao.

539
00:33:26,620 --> 00:33:29,140
♪Why I stupid to prove♪

540
00:33:29,260 --> 00:33:30,300
♪The love, oh...♪

541
00:33:32,350 --> 00:33:34,270
You can control your feelings for someone.

542
00:33:36,790 --> 00:33:37,750
If you mind,

543
00:33:38,030 --> 00:33:39,640
we can keep our relationship a secret.

544
00:33:41,030 --> 00:33:42,550
Encourage you. Praise you more.

545
00:33:42,790 --> 00:33:43,550
I'll remember that.

546
00:33:45,030 --> 00:33:45,960
We promised

547
00:33:46,750 --> 00:33:47,960
to be honest with each other.

548
00:33:50,440 --> 00:33:52,110
I'm not good with sweet words,

549
00:33:52,310 --> 00:33:53,350
but I miss you.

550
00:33:54,160 --> 00:33:55,070
I want to see you.

551
00:33:59,030 --> 00:34:00,110
He couldn't express himself.

552
00:34:00,680 --> 00:34:01,550
He didn't know how to love.

553
00:34:02,920 --> 00:34:04,030
He lacked empathy.

554
00:34:05,640 --> 00:34:06,960
He once got into a fight.

555
00:34:07,960 --> 00:34:08,880
He pretended to be sick.

556
00:34:13,360 --> 00:34:14,510
And for Shang Zhitao,

557
00:34:15,150 --> 00:34:16,320
he traveled across

558
00:34:17,030 --> 00:34:18,360
many cities

559
00:34:19,480 --> 00:34:20,320
just to see her.

560
00:34:21,550 --> 00:34:22,630
Quietly.

561
00:34:23,020 --> 00:34:24,940
♪My fool♪

562
00:34:28,180 --> 00:34:30,620
♪But I used to say♪

563
00:34:30,660 --> 00:34:34,540
♪We could take anything away♪

564
00:34:35,580 --> 00:34:36,700
♪Away♪

565
00:34:37,980 --> 00:34:44,020
♪It's fate that guides me to you♪

566
00:34:46,780 --> 00:34:49,100
♪You are my life...♪

567
00:34:50,030 --> 00:34:52,630
These are little Tao's handprints and footprints from when she was born.

568
00:34:53,480 --> 00:34:56,360
These were her tiny shoes and mittens.

569
00:34:56,880 --> 00:34:58,590
And this was her favorite Walkman.

570
00:35:00,400 --> 00:35:01,760
You worked hard last night.

571
00:35:01,860 --> 00:35:04,140
♪Live in my eyes...♪

572
00:35:04,150 --> 00:35:05,800
Actually, he is

573
00:35:06,670 --> 00:35:08,000
