577
00:35:21,860 --> 00:35:25,420
[Shang Zhitao's Bucket List Before Turning 30]

578
00:35:28,000 --> 00:35:28,710
It's

579
00:35:30,230 --> 00:35:32,000
my bucket list.

580
00:35:35,500 --> 00:35:38,500
♪Just hold my hand♪

581
00:35:40,860 --> 00:35:43,300
♪Take me away...♪

582
00:35:45,060 --> 00:35:48,660
[Shang Zhitao's Bucket List Before Turning 30]

583
00:35:51,500 --> 00:35:56,340
[Shang Zhitao's Bucket List Before Turning 30]

584
00:35:58,190 --> 00:35:59,030
Shang Zhitao.

585
00:36:01,400 --> 00:36:02,670
